  ('Gate 2', 3, 'Design DSN', 'Engage ENG', 'Who is going to make it happen; contracting gets its own gate so the silence rule bites'),
  ('Gate 3', 4, 'Advance', 'Advance (redefined)', 'What they need to make it happen; the production sense of the word'),
  ('Gate criteria', 5, '32', '35', 'Remapped to 4.0 gates; G2.ACCOUNTABLE_PARTY, G3.PERMITS_FILED, G3.PO_BASELINE added'),
  ('Ramp-up categories', 6, 'Discover, Design, Advance activities', 'Scope, Engage, Advance activities', 'Gate buckets follow the gates'),
