  ('0000.02.01-XPMS-004', '0000.02.01', 'Pro Forma & Scenario Modelling', 'Pro Forma & Scenario Modelling', 'service', 'each', 'Standard', 'Revenue and cost scenarios across attendance, pricing and scope variants, showing where the engagement breaks even and where it fails. Scenario modelling, not a forecast.', null, 'Y', 'kind service', '05', null, null, null, '5000', null, 'CC-VENUE', null, 'XPMS 3.0 canon', 'Exact', 'Proposed', null, null),
